## What to deliver

Build the pulse up operation by operation until each `frames/<index>.png` matches
the brief: a clean ring centered on (64, 64), small and bright in frame 0,
expanding outward and fading to a wide faint ring by frame 7, drawn only in
grayscale on full transparency. Played in order the frames must read as one
sonar wavefront traveling out. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
per-frame action logs are your finished submission.
